    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will offer the game E-book, with the full game story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Destiny E-book tells\u00a0 a story with more than 300 pages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/extras/895e923f3051483686f32e28ee6f6a7e.avif?t=1745774454\" width=246 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth. The &quot;S.T.A.R.&quot; (Space and Time Anomalie Researcher), detected something on the Moon...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something powerfull that needs to be investigated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We weren't prepared for that... They came from the depths of the void...to conquer.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Envolve yourself with your believes in this RPG Action/Adventure to discover what is behind this anomalie...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...And save the Earth!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Destiny is na Adventure/Action, Sci-fi, Fantasy RPG game created with the RPGMaker MZ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an Adventure game with turn-based battles based in the rpg maker game concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as John the STAR Laboratory Chief Security who will travel to the Moon, to retrive a Time-Space anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That strange object will reveal some powers like Psionics that will help you through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, a powerfull enemy from a distant galaxy discovers Earth and wishes to conquer it, due to the rich materials on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission will be to discover the secrets of the object, and with that knwoledge defeat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K'raan the Artnoc Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/extras/a50e21666fa1e7cdcb2096ea1ce2ae38.poster.avif?t=1745774454\" width=483 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/extras/a50e21666fa1e7cdcb2096ea1ce2ae38.webm?t=1745774454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth. The &quot;S.T.A.R.&quot; (Space and Time Anomalie Researcher), detected something on the Moon...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something powerfull that needs to be investigated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We weren't prepared for that... They came from the depths of the void...to conquer.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Envolve yourself with your believes in this RPG Action/Adventure to discover what is behind this anomalie...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...And save the Earth!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Destiny is na Adventure/Action, Sci-fi, Fantasy RPG game created with the RPGMaker MZ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an Adventure game with turn-based battles based in the rpg maker game concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as John the STAR Laboratory Chief Security who will travel to the Moon, to retrive a Time-Space anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That strange object will reveal some powers like Psionics that will help you through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, a powerfull enemy from a distant galaxy discovers Earth and wishes to conquer it, due to the rich materials on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission will be to discover the secrets of the object, and with that knwoledge defeat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K'raan the Artnoc Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/extras/a50e21666fa1e7cdcb2096ea1ce2ae38.poster.avif?t=1745774454\" width=483 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651670/extras/a50e21666fa1e7cdcb2096ea1ce2ae38.webm?t=1745774454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
